    "message": "A2-DYN: complete physical-word pressure and exact-record roof variation\n\nContinue the complete native 260–322 author source with full proof modules 323–326: physical-roof BV and height, complete canonical collision-boundary budgets, exact marked-record BV and Fourier estimates, and the unrestricted original physical-word pressure theorem.\n\nPreserve the true triangular Lorentz gas, original radius family, physical clock, actual section and return events, collision records, normalization, and raw four-coordinate target. Complete the inherited geometric pressure input using an exhaustive physical boundary stopping argument; retain the original normalized same-roof shortage and remaining joint spectral/conditional interfaces as explicit unclosed obligations.\n\nPreserve the exact complete predecessor article tree 7bcaba2bc1ef7ab393c81a7df84f3e45983c4dfa, all earlier evidence, and the actual controlling-report scope. Add the complete 233-page native manuscript, 26/883-page historical rebuilds, point-by-point author response, dependency and literature audits, exact verification programs, actual execution receipts, and a dedicated isolated workflow.\n\nFrozen local release: 34 programs executed in ordinary and optimized Python (68 successful commands), 59 matching comparisons, 78 native TeX inputs, and source preservation verified. Remote CI is to be read from this actual source commit; no future success or complete raw LLT is asserted.",
